   "speech": "Ranum had met many such people. Their path demanded resurrection. Meanwhile, having caught the tone of fate with regard to this passer-by, the yogi saw that within two hours at the latest the man dead in spirit would die in body as well. As yet he could not determine what manner of death would make an end of him, but he was filled with great compassion for the unfortunate man. A man who ends his days with a dead soul departs forever from the circle of perfection and of the final attainment of bliss in Nirvana. This man was living through his last incarnation. He was losing everything, without suspecting it.",
